Package: ember
Title: Reactive Notebooks for R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jonathan", "Chen", email = "jonathanwchen@pm.me", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("The Pluto.jl authors", role = "cph",
           comment = "frontend in inst/frontend, forked from Pluto.jl (MIT)"))
Description: A reactive notebook engine for R in the style of 'Pluto.jl'.
    Cells are read statically into a dependency graph, so editing a cell
    reruns the cells that depend on it.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Copyright: See inst/COPYRIGHTS.
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-GB
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
